UnitDeployL2Contracts::run
└── when initialization parameters are set up
    ├── when precomputed addresses are correct
    │   ├── it deploys Escrow implementation
    │   ├── it deploys PaymentManager implementation
    │   ├── it deploys Rewarder implementation
    │   ├── it deploys StakingRegistry implementation
    │   ├── it deploys StakedGEOToken implementation
    │   ├── it deploys StakingManager implementation
    │   ├── it deploys and initializes StakingRegistry proxy
    │   ├── it deploys and initializes StakedGEOToken proxy
    │   ├── it deploys and initializes StakingManager proxy
    │   ├── it deploys and initializes Rewarder proxy
    │   ├── it deploys and initializes Escrow proxy
    │   └── it deploys and initializes PaymentManager proxy
    ├── when StakingRegistry proxy precomputed address is incorrect
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
    ├── when StakedGEOToken proxy precomputed address is incorrect
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
    ├── when StakingManager proxy precomputed address is incorrect
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
    ├── when Rewarder proxy precomputed address is incorrect
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
    ├── when Escrow proxy precomputed address is incorrect
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
    └── when PaymentManager proxy precomputed address is incorrect
        └── it reverts with InvalidPrecomputedAddress
